{%- comment -%}
  The first brand moment. Black, the mark surfacing out of it, a counter that
  reads like an edition number. Removes itself on load; if anything at all goes
  wrong it is removed by a timeout in gr.js, and with no JS it never shows.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="boot" data-boot hidden>
  <div class="boot__stage">
    <img class="boot__mark" src="{{ 'gr-mark-chrome-sm.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="520" height="523">
  </div>
  <p class="boot__count t-num" data-boot-count>001</p>
  <span class="boot__rule"><span data-boot-fill></span></span>
</div>
